    {
      "id": "5414921A0D3DEFE9",
      "title": "&f&lKinetic Mechanism&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fComplete the Kinetic Mechanism assembly in the exact listed order.",
        "",
        "&fAssemble one Kinetic Mechanism through its complete ordered sequence. Each material application consumes one item; the last Deployer holds the finishing tool. One full loop gives one guaranteed mechanism.",
        "",
        "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
        "&61. &fStart with Wooden Slabs.",
        "&62. &fDeploy Andesite Alloy.",
        "&63. &fDeploy Andesite Alloy.",
        "&64. &fFinish with Iron Hammer in the last Deployer.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fRepeated ingredients are separate ordered applications. Feed them individually, then extract the finished mechanism into a buffer.",
        "",
        "&c&l! WATCH OUT&r",
        "&fOrdinary finishing tools lose durability. The chapter reward grants the unbreakable version after you complete the workshop."
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "2D4C276157B50541"
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
