    {
      "id": "2988658D06CB9D16",
      "title": "&f&lKinetic Machine&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fComplete the detected item or boss goal below.",
        "",
        "&fDeploy this tier’s mechanism onto its listed casing. Tier 1 also has the expensive manual startup route. Functional machines also require their listed working parts. Stonecutting is reserved for the listed passive fittings.",
        "",
        "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
        "&61. &fPut Andesite Casing on the belt or depot.",
        "&62. &fDeploy Kinetic Mechanism onto it.",
        "&63. &fFollow the machine’s exact recipe: frame plus working parts. Use stonecutting only for listed passive fittings.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fEach machine consumes its own frame and the listed parts. Stock Alloy, sheets, shafts and tools for the complete workshop."
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "5414921A0D3DEFE9"
      ],
